ns best. She could also note that we still need to discuss Candidates A and B before final decision, but she can keep her vote for C.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with Emily that Candidate C is the best, and here's why...\" Provide evidence: 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere, quick correct decisions, technical competence. Acknowledge concerns: egocentric, communication difficulty, not willing to further education, but argue they are less critical than D's hot temper and weak leadership, and A and B have more serious issues. So maintain vote for C.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
